{% block brandDescription %}
      <p class="brand-description">Founded in 1974 by Bob Taylor and Kurt Listug, Taylor Guitars has grown from a small San Diego shop into a premier global manufacturer of acoustic and electric guitars. Known for utilizing modern, innovative manufacturing techniques and high-end craftsmanship, Taylor is recognized for its playability and, like the V-Class bracing, distinctive, bright sound. The company is 100% employee-owned, operates factories in California and Mexico, and is a leading brand in the musical instrument industry.<br><a href="#" class="decoder-howto-link" data-modal-target="howto-taylor">(How to decode a Taylor serial #)</a></p>
